== <space>e (kakmux, 160 cols)
%1 1 40 broot 1 @RUN/p/proj
%0 0 119 kak  @RUN/p/proj
ok   broot pane, 40 columns, focused
== <space>e again: focus
ok   broot focused again
%0 1 160 kak  @RUN/p/proj
== <space>E (buffer dir)
